WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to newly developed
technology, we here at

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:05.605
"Late Night" have the ability
to record the tiny voice that is

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:07.107 line:92%
inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:09.009
And you might be surprised
to know that like everyone's

00:00:09.009 --> 00:00:12.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
inner voice, Donald Trump's
is filled with paralyzing fear

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:15.248 align:start size:94% position:6%
and self-doubt.
So here is the tiny voice

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:18.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the back of
Donald Trump's head.

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:21.788 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.690 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Something that we think
is very valuable.

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.457 line:92%
-[ As Trump ] Hey, Donald.

00:00:24.457 --> 00:00:27.060
It's the tiny voice in the back
of your head, and I'm here

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:28.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
to remind you that
you hate being President,

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:32.298
and you would give anything
right now to trade places

00:00:32.298 --> 00:00:35.769 align:start size:94% position:6%
with this little kid in
his dad's lap to your right.

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:38.538 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to pretend to listen
to this lady, and nod.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:42.108
Meanwhile, he gets to play
with his dad's big old hand.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:45.612 size:84% position:42%
Looks like so much fun,
rocking back and forth.

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.547 line:92%
And you have to sit still.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.916
He probably gets to throw
a temper tantrum, too.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:53.353
When he throws a temper tantrum
it's cute, but when you do it,

00:00:53.353 --> 00:00:56.923 size:78% position:39%
everyone on CNN says,
"Oh, he's a baby."

00:00:56.923 --> 00:00:58.358 line:92%
Oh no, he's going to yawn.

00:00:58.358 --> 00:01:00.326 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you want to yawn
so bad, and oh,

00:01:00.326 --> 00:01:02.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
that lucky son of
a bitch is taking a nap.

00:01:02.896 --> 00:01:04.264 line:92%
-Intellectual property rights.

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:06.800 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ As Trump ] Hey, Donald.
It's me, the tiny voice

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the back
in your head and wow,

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:11.871
look at your Secretary
of Commerce, Wilbur Ross.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:14.908
You thought you would get
to work with the coolest people

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:18.611
if you were President,
but look who is in your cabinet:

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:24.617
A very small man hovering around
the age of 112 who does not know

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:26.386 line:92%
how to lower a microphone.

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:29.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
It looks like his eyeballs
are giving a speech.

00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:32.325
And if his eyeballs were giving
a speech I bet they'd say,

00:01:32.325 --> 00:01:35.562 size:81% position:41%
"Somebody get us out
of this old-ass head."

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.297 align:start size:94% position:6%
No one is watching
this right now saying,

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:40.433
"Oh, I wish I could switch
places with Donald Trump,

00:01:40.433 --> 00:01:44.337 align:start size:94% position:6%
and hang out with Wilbur Ross,
and Mike Pence."

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:46.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look what you've done
with your life.

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:48.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
You used to roll
with porn stars, and now

00:01:48.575 --> 00:01:52.779 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're with Boresville
and Snoresville.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:54.180 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Sad.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.649 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

